[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/John Byron/Rocky Block/Jacob Durrett/Blake Pendergrass/Ryan Vojtesak/James Maddocks
[00:16.26]There was a day Jack and Jim didn't know me from Adam
[00:16.26]曾几何时，杰克和吉姆连我是谁都认不出
[00:19.87]And Eve wasn't some what's-her-name in my bed
[00:19.87]夏娃也不过是我床上某个连名字都不记得的过客
[00:23.56]It's like outta the dark I saw the neon a-flashin'
[00:23.56]仿佛从黑暗中我瞥见了霓虹闪烁
[00:27.16]Heard the snake on my shoulder give me the go-ahead
[00:27.16]听见肩头的毒蛇催促我快走
