[00:30.91]于是我浅尝一口
[00:33.37]And I didn't stop there, I swear
[00:33.37]我发誓，再没停下脚步
[00:35.93]From the time I wake up to the time I lay down
[00:35.93]从睁眼到闭眼
[00:39.59]It's the devil's playground everywhere that I look
[00:39.59]目之所及皆是魔鬼的游乐场
[00:43.09]Swear it's there in my blood, I was born to be lost
[00:43.09]骨血里刻着烙印，我生来注定迷失方向
[00:46.70]Lotta lines that I cross little more than I should
